      <div class="vt-intro__image-col">
        <div class="vt-intro__image-wrap">
          <img
            src="/images/vista-window-film-philadelphia-intro.jpg"
            alt="Vista authorized installer applying premium window film in Philadelphia"
            title="Vista authorized installer applying premium window film in Philadelphia"
            width="848"
            height="1264"
            loading="lazy"
            class="vt-intro__img"
          />
          <div class="vt-intro__badge">
            <Icon name="lucide:award" aria-hidden="true" />
            <span>Vista Authorized Installer</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="vt-intro__content">
        <span class="vt-intro__eyebrow">Why Vista &amp; Window Film Philadelphia</span>
        <h2 class="vt-intro__title">Vista: Eastman's Premium Architectural Film Line, Installed in Philadelphia</h2>
        <p class="vt-intro__lead">Vista is the premium architectural window film brand in the Eastman Performance Films family — the same group that produces LLumar and Solar Gard. Where LLumar is the commercial workhorse, Vista is positioned for design-forward projects where aesthetics, performance documentation, and architect approval are all requirements. Vista window tint in Philadelphia is available through Window Film Philadelphia across the full SpectraSelect, Low-E, Dual Reflective, and Safety lineups.</p>
        <p class="vt-intro__body">Window Film Philadelphia is an authorized Vista dealer and installer. That means we carry the full Vista architectural lineup — and every installation includes a manufacturer-issued warranty, NFRC-certified product specs, and installation records for your building files. Every project is specified when the film needs to satisfy both the design team and the facilities team.</p>
        <div class="vt-intro__creds">
          {['Vista Authorized Installer', 'Licensed & Insured', 'Serving Philadelphia Since 2008', 'NFRC-Certified Products'].map((cred) => (
            <div class="vt-intro__cred">
              <Icon name="lucide:check-circle-2" aria-hidden="true" />
              {cred}
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="vt-trust">
    <div class="vt-trust__inner">
      <p class="vt-trust__label">Philadelphia's authorized Vista installer — stocking the full architectural film lineup</p>
      <div class="vt-trust__badges" aria-label="Vista installer credentials">
        {['Vista Authorized Installer', 'Licensed & Insured', 'Manufacturer-Backed Warranty', 'NFRC-Certified'].map((badge) => (
          <span>{badge}</span>
        ))}
